### SECTION 2: AUTHENTICATION MODULE
### ============================================================================

### 2.1 Register New User (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@tbdetection.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123!",
  "firstName": "Admin",
  "lastName": "User",
  "role": "admin",
  "phone": "+1234567890",
  "license": "ADM001",
  "specialization": "Hospital Admin"
}

### 2.2 Register Physician User
