Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "physician@tbdetection.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123!",
  "firstName": "Dr.",
  "lastName": "Smith",
  "role": "physician",
  "specialization": "Pulmonologist",
  "license": "LIC123456",
  "phone": "+1234567891"
}

### 2.3 Register Radiologist User
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

