### 📋 VALIDATION FLOW:
### 1. ML Service Health Check
###    - If service is DOWN → Returns 400 "ML model service is not available"
###
### 2. Image Format Validation
###    - If not JPEG/PNG/DICOM → Returns 400 "Invalid X-ray image format"
###    - Checks file magic numbers (signatures)
###
### 3. X-Ray Validity Check (AI Model)
###    - Sends to ML service: predict/xray_validation endpoint
###    - If confidence < 0.7 → Returns 400 "Image is not a valid medical X-ray"
###    - If passes → Confidence > 0.7
###
### 4. TB Diagnosis (If X-Ray Valid)
###    - Automatic TB prediction via ML model
###    - Generates confidence scores and recommendations
###
### Extract patient ID from response and paste into @patientId at the top

### 4.2 Get All Patients (Physicians see their own, Admins see all)
GET {{baseUrl}}/patients
Authorization: Bearer {{physicianToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 4.3 Get Patient by ID (with X-ray and Diagnosis relations)
GET {{baseUrl}}/patients/{{patientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{physicianToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 4.4 Update Patient
PUT {{baseUrl}}/patients/{{patientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{physicianToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "john.doe.updated@example.com",
  "phone": "+1234567890",
  "dateOfBirth": "1980-05-15",
  "gender": "Male",
  "medicalHistory": "Hypertension, Diabetes, Asthma",
  "allergies": "Penicillin, Sulfa",
  "medications": "Metformin 500mg twice daily, Salbutamol inhaler"
}

### 4.5 Delete Patient (Soft Delete - data preserved)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/patients/{{patientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{physicianToken}}

