### SECTION 10: DIAGNOSIS RESULTS MODULE
### ============================================================================

### 10.1 Create Diagnosis Result (After TB Prediction)
# @name createDiagnosis
POST {{baseUrl}}/diagnosis-results
Authorization: Bearer {{physicianToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "{{patientId}}",
  "xrayId": "{{xrayId}}",
  "diseaseType": "tuberculosis",
  "prediction": "TB detected in left upper lobe",
  "confidenceScore": 0.92,
  "confidenceLevel": "high",
  "tbIntensity": "moderate",
  "affectedAreas": "Left upper lobe",
  "affectedPercentage": 25,
  "mlModelUsed": "tb_classifier.pth",
  "radiologistNotes": "Characteristic TB findings consistent with active TB",
  "recommendedAction": "Initiate anti-TB therapy immediately"
}

### Extract diagnosis ID
### Copy id from response above and paste into @diagnosisId at the top

### 10.2 Get All Diagnosis Results
GET {{baseUrl}}/diagnosis-results
Authorization: Bearer {{physicianToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 10.3 Get Diagnosis by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/diagnosis-results/{{diagnosisId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{physicianToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 10.4 List Diagnosis Results (filter on client-side by patientId)
GET {{baseUrl}}/diagnosis-results
Authorization: Bearer {{physicianToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 10.5 Alternative: Get Diagnosis by ID if you know the diagnosisId
GET {{baseUrl}}/diagnosis-results/{{diagnosisId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{physicianToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 10.6 Delete Diagnosis Result
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/diagnosis-results/{{diagnosisId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{physicianToken}}

