POST {{mlServiceUrl}}/predict/tb
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "image_base64": ""
}

### Response should contain: { tb_detected: boolean, confidence: number, prediction: string }

### 11.2 Direct ML Service - X-Ray Validation Test
POST {{mlServiceUrl}}/validate/xray
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "image_base64": ""
}

### Response should contain: { is_xray: boolean, confidence: number, prediction: string }

